        <span class="eyebrow">Commercial Title</span>
        <h2 style="margin:1rem 0 1.1rem">Commercial title insurance.</h2>
        <p class="lead">Unlike residential properties, commercial ones usually carry a hefty price tag and involve intricate negotiations. Safeguarding your investment to its fullest extent — commensurate with its value — is paramount.</p>
        <p style="color:var(--slate);margin-top:1rem">With over two decades of experience, our team prioritizes prompt, precise assistance to meet attorney and paralegal deadlines. Contact us today to learn more.</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="grid grid-3">
      <div class="card reveal" data-tilt>
        <div class="card__icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M3 21h18M6 21V7l6-4 6 4v14"/><path d="M9 9h.01M15 9h.01M9 13h.01M15 13h.01"/></svg></div>
        <h3>What property needs it?</h3>
        <p>Title insurance is common across all real estate, but its significance escalates in commercial deals due to higher purchase prices and complex agreements. Comprehensive coverage guards against any potential occurrence.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="card reveal" data-d="1" data-tilt>
        <div class="card__icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M12 2l7 4v6c0 5-3.5 8-7 10-3.5-2-7-5-7-10V6l7-4z"/></svg></div>
        <h3>Why you need it</h3>
        <p>Commercial title insurance protects the investor if complications arise with the property's title — from negligence to clerical errors or fraud. Without it, an investor risks their entire investment with no financial recourse.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="card reveal" data-d="2" data-tilt>
        <div class="card__icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M4 7V4h16v3M9 20h6M12 4v16"/></svg></div>
        <h3>Policies &amp; who pays</h3>
        <p>There are two policies: the lender's and the owner's. If the buyer uses a lender, they purchase both. The lender's policy lasts the life of the loan; the owner's lasts as long as you own the property. We strongly advise an owner's policy.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <p style="text-align:center;color:var(--slate);max-width:640px;margin:2.2rem auto 0" class="reveal">Given the complexity of commercial real estate, selecting the right agency is paramount. Our team delivers top-notch, prompt, and precise service to meet your deadlines.</p>
